## runtimeSingleton.ts
@flow-hash: 6ea423fe

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant UserScriptRuntime
    participant localStorage
    participant pluginHost
    participant event-dispatcher
    participant chat-store
    participant globalScriptsStore
    participant AccessibilitySettings
    participant ChatSettings
    participant StrictChatClassifier
    participant dslToAnsi
    participant Window

    UserScriptRuntime->>localStorage: Load scripts and state
    UserScriptRuntime->>globalScriptsStore: Get global vars snapshot
    UserScriptRuntime->>pluginHost: Set alias fallback handler
    loop Timer Tick
        Window->>UserScriptRuntime: tickTimers()
    end

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle game:remote-server:raw
    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle game:remote-server:gmcp
    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle game:remote-server:error
    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle game:remote-server:close

    event-dispatcher->>chat-store: Append chat line
    chat-store->>StrictChatClassifier: Classify chat subtype
    StrictChatClassifier-->>chat-store: Return subtype
    chat-store->>ChatSettings: Get chat settings
    ChatSettings-->>chat-store: Return settings

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle shatteredarchive:connection-changed
    UserScriptRuntime->>localStorage: Rehydrate scripts and state
    UserScriptRuntime->>globalScriptsStore: Get global vars snapshot

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle shatteredarchive:userScripts-updated
    UserScriptRuntime->>localStorage: Rehydrate scripts and state

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle shatteredarchive:accessibility-updated
    UserScriptRuntime->>AccessibilitySettings: Get accessibility settings

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle game:char-data
    UserScriptRuntime->>dslToAnsi: Convert DSL to ANSI
    dslToAnsi-->>event-dispatcher: Send terminal write event

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle storage event
    UserScriptRuntime->>localStorage: Rehydrate scripts and state

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle shatteredarchive:named-var:set
    UserScriptRuntime->>Window: Update named var map

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle shatteredarchive:named-var:delete
    UserScriptRuntime->>Window: Delete named var from map

    event-dispatcher->>UserScriptRuntime: Handle shatteredarchive:named-var:clear
    UserScriptRuntime->>Window: Clear named var map
```

Caption: The RuntimeSingleton orchestrates user script execution, manages connection state and named variables, handles events from the game and UI, and integrates with storage, plugins, and chat systems.

## userScriptRuntime.ts
@flow-hash: 28dc6c40

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as UserScriptRuntime
    participant E as EventDispatcher
    participant L as localStorage
    participant G as globalScriptsStore
    participant T as triggerOmitStore
    participant S as ScriptSandboxApi

    U->>E: ListenEvent('shatteredarchive:raw-data')
    U->>E: ListenEvent('shatteredarchive:gmcp-data')
    U->>E: ListenEvent('shatteredarchive:userScripts-updated')
    U->>E: ListenEvent('shatteredarchive:globalVars-updated')

    E->>U: processRawEvent(payload)
    U->>U: processForSpecialLines(line)
    U->>E: DispatchEvent('event:*')
    U->>E: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:write-terminal')

    E->>U: processGmcpEvent(payload)
    U->>U: dispatchGmcpEvent(eventName, rawText)
    U->>E: DispatchEvent(eventName, data)

    U->>E: ListenEvent('shatteredarchive:alias-fired')
    U->>U: executeAlias(input)
    U->>U: executeScript(script, context)
    U->>S: runUserScript(script, apiRef)
    S->>E: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:send-command')
    S->>E: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:write-terminal')

    U->>U: tickTimers()
    U->>U: executeScript(script)
    U->>S: runUserScript(script, apiRef)

    U->>L: loadScriptsFromStorage(connectionId)
    U->>L: saveScriptsToStorage(connectionId)
    U->>G: getGlobalVarsSnapshot(connectionId)
    U->>T: setOmitRules(rules, connectionId)

    U->>E: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:userScripts-updated')
    U->>E: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:globalVars-updated')
    U->>E: DispatchEvent('shatteredarchive:identity-updated')
```

Caption: The UserScriptRuntime orchestrates script execution, event handling, and storage interactions for user-defined scripts in a MUD client environment.
